{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo Version</strong> features 20 fish species and diverse NPCs. The <strong>Full Release</strong> will expand to over 50 fish species, 16 kittens, richer map exploration, and enhanced gameplay \u2013 stay tuned! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RAISE YOUR BELOVED CAT(S)!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a lively world where you can nurture adorable cats, collect exotic fish, and interact with vibrant NPCs! Forge heartwarming feline friendships, catch rare species, showcase master fishing skills, and become the town's most recognized fishing expert!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/20250617-191342.gif?t=1753709727\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FISH WITH YOUR CAT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover breathtaking landscapes \u2013 from serene lakes to bustling harbor. Upgrade your gear to tackle greater challenges, complete quests to unlock rare fish, and deepen bonds with your cat(s).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/20250617-190004.gif?t=1753709727\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CATCH THE ULTIMATE TROPHY FISH!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab your best rod, prepare your bait, and test your skills at the water's edge. With patience, precision, and a bit of luck, you might just reel in the biggest catch of your life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/20250617-185546.gif?t=1753709727\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><stron