! Forge heartwarming feline friendships, catch rare species, showcase master fishing skills, and become the town's most recognized fishing expert!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/20250617-191342.gif?t=1753709727\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FISH WITH YOUR CAT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover breathtaking landscapes \u2013 from serene lakes to bustling harbor. Upgrade your gear to tackle greater challenges, complete quests to unlock rare fish, and deepen bonds with your cat(s).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/20250617-190004.gif?t=1753709727\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CATCH THE ULTIMATE TROPHY FISH!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab your best rod, prepare your bait, and test your skills at the water's edge. With patience, precision, and a bit of luck, you might just reel in the biggest catch of your life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/20250617-185546.gif?t=1753709727\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PLAY WITH YOUR CAT(S)!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed around pet socialization, &quot;<strong>PAW PARTY: COZY TOWN</strong>&quot; lets you play at camp with your feline companions, make new friends, and share the joy of fishing together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/20250617-190737.gif?t=1753709727\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div cl